WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.270
Friday, 12 May 2017.

2
00:00:03.320 --> 00:00:06.470
Across England, NHS
services start to fail,

3
00:00:06.520 --> 00:00:08.890
all on the same day.

4
00:00:08.940 --> 00:00:13.970
At least 81 of England's 236
NHS trusts are disrupted,

5
00:00:14.020 --> 00:00:20.345
plus 603 other NHS organisations,
including 595 GP practices.

6
00:00:20.395 --> 00:00:27.190
NHS England later identifies
6,912 cancelled appointments.

7
00:00:27.240 --> 00:00:29.730
Nobody broke into a single building.

8
00:00:29.780 --> 00:00:30.950
So what happened?

9
00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:32.270
A national power cut?

10
00:00:32.320 --> 00:00:33.450
A strike?

11
00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:37.290
In this mission, you'll trace
what happened and what followed.

12
00:00:37.340 --> 00:00:40.150
Then you'll weigh national
security against privacy,

13
00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:44.770
in a 2021 judgment of the
European Court of Human Rights.

14
00:00:44.820 --> 00:00:51.720
Your mission: find out what disrupted
at least 81 NHS trusts on 12 May 2017.
